WEBVTT

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.720
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:20.140
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:23.940
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:00:32.780 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:39.030
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.580
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.870
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:49.250
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:54.760
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:59.100
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.430
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:09.440
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:13.610
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:22.740
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:27.710
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>And dream my dream</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>yume wo miru</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>And know my dream</i>

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.800
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:50.480
THE EXTREME ANNIHILATION SPELL, MEDROA

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.440
You're looking much better.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:53.570
Yes.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:55.990
Can I get you anything?

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:57.030
No.

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.450
I'll bring some fruits.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.120
Th-Thank you.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:07.160
Yo.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:10.210
The leaders have finished their meeting.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.000
The showdown is in five days.

00:02:14.170 --> 00:02:16.300
So they finally made up their minds.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:20.010
It's a collaborative effort
between countries, so it took a while.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.770
We'll be gathering in Carl Kingdom,
south of the Field of Death.

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.850
Carl Kingdom is in ruins.

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:30.060
We're using the ruins
as a cover to build a base.

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:33.690
Our group will head out the day before.

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:37.900
So for the next four days
I'm going to my mentor's place.

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.070
It's not just me.

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:45.370
Maam, Crocodine and Chiu are all training.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.580
You guys make sure to rest up.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.540
I need to get ready too.

00:02:50.710 --> 00:02:51.790
Dai.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.290
Are you healed?

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:54.380
Yeah.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.630
We have somewhere to go.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.100
Hyunckel...

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.720
Where...

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.140
They've all gone.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:09.810
Huh?!

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:14.110
With the showdown date set,
the Disciples of Avan have all left.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.610
Including Dai and Hyunckel.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:18.360
But...

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.240
His wounds haven't fully healed yet.

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:27.790
Why does he rush into battle so quickly?

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:34.170
He only rests when
he's too wounded to fight.

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:37.750
It's like he's cursed to keep fighting.

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:42.300
They're the only ones
who can save the world.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:49.180
All we can do is support them
to ease their burden.

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.180
That includes Hyunckel.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.560
Sister!

00:03:57.070 --> 00:04:03.110
My weapons can recover
from this sort of damage on their own.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:06.370
But I can fix them if you're in a hurry.

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:09.120
He seems to be
in a really bad mood.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.700
It's probably your fault.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.710
Mine? Why?

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.000
You two.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.500
Time to teach you a lesson.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:23.340
If you think the Sword of Champions
beat you because it's made of Orichalcum,

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.390
then I'll knock some sense into you.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.680
I guess it was my fault.

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:30.310
Step outside.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.770
Huh?! You're going to use a sword?

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:36.190
<i>He knows how to fight with a sword?</i>

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:38.480
I said I'd teach you a lesson.

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:43.490
That sword is this world's greatest!
I can't make anything stronger!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:49.200
Your only hope to fight better
is for you to grow stronger!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.090
What's wrong?

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:03.840
What hope do you have
if you can't match someone like me?

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:07.550
<i>This is no joke... He's strong!</i>

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:12.270
<i>I can't believe someone this good
was still out there in the world.</i>

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.020
Very well.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:19.610
Those weapons will
go to waste in your hands.

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:24.820
Once they're restored,
I'll show you how to really use them...

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:27.360
through actual combat!

00:05:28.910 --> 00:05:31.410
That's the Valge Whirlpool.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:36.330
Sorry Chiu.
I'll need your help with my training.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.380
Absolutely! I'm glad to help!

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.340
Okay!

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.300
So, an Orichalcum Superbeing Army...

00:05:51.470 --> 00:05:53.140
That's bad news.

00:05:53.310 --> 00:05:55.680
It's not their strength that's bad news.

00:05:55.850 --> 00:05:57.560
It's also their minds.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.020
Their minds?

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:02.520
The Forbidden Magic of giving life
to inanimate materials

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:06.610
is heavily affected by the mentality
of whoever uses it.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:10.820
Flazzard was created back when Hadlar
was obsessed with power.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:14.910
<i>He was a violent piece of trash
who cared only for glory, remember?</i>

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.200
I see.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:21.750
If that Royal Guard
actually cares about a fair fight,

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:26.800
then it means Hadlar himself
has grown as a warrior.

00:06:26.970 --> 00:06:31.260
So the members of the Royal Guard
created by the new Hadlar

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.760
are each stronger than Flazzard.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.720
Not only that...

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:40.310
until now, you guys have managed
to get by using teamwork.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.060
Now they're going to use it, too.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:45.110
This'll be difficult.

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:50.240
Mentor, please,
is there anything I can do?!

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:55.120
<i>Hym repelled a spell
ten times stronger than a Kafrizz!</i>

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:58.910
A normal flame spell won't work on him!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:01.830
Not with an Orichalcum body.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.420
What can I do?!

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:11.180
Let's go outside.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:14.300
Mentor, are you sure you can get up?!

00:07:14.470 --> 00:07:15.560
Are you okay?!

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:18.220
Don't worry about me.

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:24.270
Speaking of Flazzard,
he was pretty strong, wasn't he?

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:25.400
Huh?

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.730
He used both fire and ice.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.110
R-Right.

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:33.660
The idea was good, but his youth
and inexperience caused him to fail.

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:39.370
Had he used fire and ice simultaneously,
you wouldn't have stood a chance.

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.870
Like this.

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:46.500
Can you do this?

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:50.760
I-I don't know.
I've never tried it before.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:52.720
This is your answer.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:58.810
Do this, and Orichalcum foe or not,
you'll always win.

00:07:59.220 --> 00:08:06.440
After all, this is the Grand Sorcerer
Matoriv's strongest extreme spell.

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.650
What a spell...

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.940
I'll teach it to you.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.990
Well, if I can manage to pull it off.

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.200
What do you mean?!

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.710
I've only used it a handful of times.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:23.080
It's too scary.

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:28.340
<i>Mentor's like a walking ball of ego,</i>

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.340
<i>and even he's scared to use it?!</i>

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:34.050
<i>Just what kind of spell is it?!</i>

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:36.510
Fire and ice.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:39.510
They may seem like opposite spells,

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:46.150
but both Fire-type and Ice-type spells
use Magic Power that control heat.

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:50.230
It's just a matter of
whether it's positive or negative.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:56.240
Push Magic Power in the positive direction
for a Fire-type spell.

00:08:56.740 --> 00:09:00.830
Push it in the negative direction
for an Ice-type spell.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:05.290
When this positive and negative
Magic Power is sparked simultaneously,

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:09.340
it becomes
the ultimate annihilating power.

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.300
I'm not sure I get it.

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:15.590
So, by combining the two powers,
it creates an annihilation spell

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:18.550
that will disintegrate anything?

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:22.720
Very good. You've grown quite perceptive.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:25.520
You're absolutely correct.

00:09:25.690 --> 00:09:27.600
It's the Extreme Annihilation Spell.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:29.310
It's called...

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.780
Medroa.

00:09:32.940 --> 00:09:34.360
Medroa?

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:37.910
This spell is unbelievably hard to cast.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:44.500
You need the skill to combine Fire-type
and Ice-type spells of exact equal power.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:47.210
But, pull it off and you're unbeatable.

00:09:47.370 --> 00:09:50.750
It doesn't matter
how resilient your opponent is.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:55.260
This spell will disintegrate
absolutely anything.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:10:00.930
And you're going to teach it to me?

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:04.970
Yeah. I will.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:09.560
This is probably the only spell
that will work on an Orichalcum enemy.

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:13.150
Great! How do I do it?!
What sort of training do I need to do?!

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:18.320
Popp, training for this is simple.

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.410
It'll only take an instant.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.660
That's even better!

00:10:22.830 --> 00:10:26.330
This spell requires
casting both spells simultaneously.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:29.620
They must be balanced perfectly.

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:32.880
Those without talent
will never pull it off.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.220
I'm going to cast it at you.

00:10:39.380 --> 00:10:40.010
Huh?

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:43.140
Cancel it out with your own Magic Power.

00:10:43.300 --> 00:10:44.140
What?

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:31.140
This spell...

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:35.360
can only be cancelled out
by the same spell!

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.360
Huh!

00:11:36.520 --> 00:11:40.490
If you can't successfully combine
the two spells,

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:43.490
you'll be erased from this world!

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.910
What?! That's crazy, Mentor!

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.040
Here goes, Popp!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.960
Pull it off if you want to live!

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.430
FULLHEAL
HEALING-TYPE SPELL

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:07.430
REFRACTOR FIST

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:12.020
<i>O-Oh crap! This is too much!</i>

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:14.980
<i>I'll have to run to dodge it!</i>

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:23.910
<i>That's right! Mentor's not well!</i>

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:30.500
<i>He's been casting Forbidden Magic-level
spells to protect his friends!</i>

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.250
<i>He's coughed up blood before!</i>

00:12:34.830 --> 00:12:38.000
<i>That spell takes such an effort to cast.</i>

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:41.710
<i>And he's willing to endure it for me!</i>

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:43.970
<i>I can't run away!</i>

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.890
<i>This is about more than just a spell!</i>

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:52.600
<i>If I run from this,
I'll have no right to call him my mentor!</i>

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:01.610
Thank you.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:06.610
Here goes!

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.250
Medroa!

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:24.010
Popp!

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.190
Good! Contain it!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:45.650
<i>Oh no! Popp was always better
at Fire-type spells!</i>

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.780
<i>The output of his left hand
is overpowering his right!</i>

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.660
Popp! Increase your Ice-type spell power!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:55.370
Increase the power from your right hand!

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:00.920
Dammit!

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:04.510
Don't vanish! Don't vanish, Popp!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:11.140
Damn it all!

00:14:20.860 --> 00:14:25.990
Oh man, I wish I could train with them.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:30.660
A princess can't just run off
and abandon her duties.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.580
Maybe I should go.

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.000
I'm kidding.

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.040
The Valge Whirlpool became two!

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:52.850
And now it's one again!

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.860
Good job, sir!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:07.110
It's possible!

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:09.900
Theoretically, it's possible!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.490
Are you okay?!

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:17.660
Y-Yeah. Sorry.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.540
You've got your own training,
yet you're helping me.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:22.960
It's nothing.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.880
I'll make it up to you.

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:27.630
I've got a gift for you.

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.220
Huh?! Really?!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:30.800
What is it?!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.680
Okay, one more time.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.620
Yo! Not bad!

00:16:02.790 --> 00:16:03.790
Popp!?

00:16:03.960 --> 00:16:08.050
Punching each drop of water that splashes.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.010
Training to increase your speed?

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.970
Yes. More speed means more force.

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:18.260
I need more instant destructive power
to damage our new enemies.

00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.060
W-What happened to your arm?!

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:25.400
Oh, nothing much.
Just training for a new spell.

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:27.690
When I mess up, this happens.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.230
I just dropped by to cool it off.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.780
What kind of spell is it?

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:36.200
You'll find out after I complete it.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:39.450
This one is seriously strong.

00:16:39.620 --> 00:16:43.080
No matter who we face,
I know I'll be able to help.

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.170
You seem confident.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.130
Yeah. You can count on me!

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:52.130
We have two days left.
I better try harder!

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:57.760
You're going to have to try a lot harder
if you want to increase your speed.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.850
You're carrying
a lot of excess weight, you know.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.890
What did you say?!

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.690
I'm joking! I'm joking!

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:19.910
Are you okay?! Are you hurt?

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.330
What the hell was that?!

00:17:21.490 --> 00:17:23.410
A trap for grappling training.

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:27.330
We're going to be facing enemies
immune to my Refractor Fist.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.550
<i>That's it. No more gazing at those legs.</i>

00:17:33.670 --> 00:17:36.680
<i>Those things are lethal.</i>

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.060
Balance...

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.110
It's about equal balance.

00:18:25.140 --> 00:18:26.310
Not again!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:37.070
How's that, Mentor?

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.410
I know my Fire-type Magic Power
is still a bit strong.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:45.580
But it's not too far off, eh?

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:58.260
I've never been more impressed
with your skill.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:03.430
That's the first time
you've ever complimented me like that.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.680
Maybe it's time you retire.

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:09.390
You kids always get ahead of yourselves.

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.060
I'm serious, Mentor.

00:19:11.230 --> 00:19:14.190
I'll learn every skill you have.

00:19:14.360 --> 00:19:16.980
So you don't have to
push yourself anymore.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:21.070
Try to look after yourself.

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:27.500
Why did you choose to be a Mage
when you became Avan's student?

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:28.250
Huh?

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:31.420
Didn't you consider
being a Warrior or a Hero?

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:33.630
Master Avan told me...

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:39.050
I sense a very, very great potential
for magic from you.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:43.760
You remind me of an old friend of mine.

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:48.930
That's why I didn't hesitate to be a Mage.

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:53.900
<i>He really had an eye for people.</i>

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:58.860
If you want me to retire,
you better really impress me.

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:04.160
Let me out of here!

00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:06.950
I'm the Mystic Legion Commander!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.290
Quiet down in there.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:15.380
You should be executed, but Lord Hadlar
mercifully granted you imprisonment.

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.500
I don't deserve imprisonment!

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.460
Learn more remorse.

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.680
Hey! Get back here!

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:27.220
If I may, Lord Hadlar...

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.310
What is it, Albinass?

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:32.140
That one should be executed at once.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.190
He's nothing but a parasite.

00:20:34.350 --> 00:20:39.650
If allowed to live, he will only
be a hinderance to you.

00:20:40.480 --> 00:20:44.450
He was the one
who worked to enhance my body.

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:48.700
It cost him his son.
There's no need to kill him.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:51.410
Let him cool off in his cell.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:54.540
Yes, My Lord. If that is your command.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:59.250
The old me would have killed him
without a second thought.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.880
Am I too soft?

00:21:02.050 --> 00:21:06.680
No. You are magnanimous,
if a bit too lenient on parasites.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:10.810
You don't hold back, do you?

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:17.560
Killvearn, I have a job for you.

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:19.860
An assassination?

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:26.320
I don't think Hadlar would appreciate
me killing the Disciples of Avan.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:29.410
It's not the Disciples.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:34.160
And I'm not even sure you'll succeed.

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:39.710
But at his core, he is still a father.

00:21:39.880 --> 00:21:45.010
While he remains silent for now,
there's no telling how he'll move next.

00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:49.550
So, eliminate the sleeping Dragon?

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:07.240
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:07.240
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.200
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:11.200
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:15.290
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:15.290
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:19.330
<i>How far will we go?</i>

00:22:15.450 --> 00:22:19.330
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:22.630
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:22.630
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:26.550
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:26.550
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:30.260
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:30.260
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:34.560
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:34.560
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:38.600
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

00:22:36.270 --> 00:22:38.600
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:42.400
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

00:22:40.150 --> 00:22:42.400
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:47.990
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:47.990
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:53.580
<i>That single little promise</i>

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:53.580
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

00:22:57.540 --> 00:22:59.670
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

00:22:57.540 --> 00:22:59.670
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:03.840
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:03.840
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.340
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

00:23:04.000 --> 00:23:08.340
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.510
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

00:23:08.510 --> 00:23:11.510
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.180
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:16.180
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:22.400
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

00:23:16.350 --> 00:23:22.400
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:38.620
<i>Dai and his friends head to Carl Kingdom
where warriors gather from all over.</i>

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:43.790
<i>As the group approaches the stronghold
of the Dark Army, the Field of Death,</i>

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:46.920
<i>they renew their resolve
to defeat the Dark King.</i>

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:52.510
<i>Meanwhile, on orders from Vearn,
Killvearn closes in on Baran.</i>

00:23:52.680 --> 00:23:55.010
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:57.060
<i>"To the Final Battleground"</i>

00:23:57.220 --> 00:23:59.430
<i>The adventure continues!</i>
